abstract: >-
  Multi-fidelity Dense Plasma Focus simulator with Lee model snowplow,
  cylindrical MHD, and 3D backends. Validated against 6 published devices
  including 24-shot PF-1000 statistical validation (1.27% mean error).
  Browser-based web UI via Gradio. 14 device presets, parameter sweeps,
  auto-calibration, and 3D Babylon.js visualization.
